## 4. 级联删除策略

删除主表记录时，先逻辑删除所有明细表，再删主表：
```sql
{% for dm in detail_modules %}
UPDATE {{ dm.table_name }} SET is_deleted = 1 WHERE {{ dm.master_fk_column }} = #{id};
{% endfor %}
UPDATE {{ master_module.table_name }} SET is_deleted = 1 WHERE id = #{id};
```
